a-value-chain","dateCreated":"2024-06-07T20:39:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-07T21:19:13+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Merck \u0026 Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA, one of the largest pharmaceutical companies in the world, has been using generative artificial intelligence (generative AI) to push the borders of data science and analytics in life sciences. Harish Nankani, Associate Vice President, Data and Analytics, Merck, and Suman Giri, Executive Director, Data Science, Merck, recently spoke to Ujjwal Ratan, Data Science and ML Leader for Healthcare and Life Sciences at AWS, on the promise and potential of this groundbreaking technology for commercial teams in life sciences organizations","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/merck_Logo%401x.d2bb12e7d696dabc89df6d7add1194a9428c0ce4.png","displayLocation":"Other","customerNameLower":"merck","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2024-04-03","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/industries/executive-conversations-the-promise-of-generative-ai-for-the-commercial-pharma-value-chain/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Merck","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Executive Conversations: The promise of generative AI for the commercial pharma value chain","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":